Portions derived from intellij-community include:
  - Diff and merge algorithms ported from platform/util/diff
    (com.intellij.diff.comparison.*, com.intellij.diff.fragments.*).
  - Diff viewer behaviour and rendering ported from platform/diff-impl and platform/diff-api
    (com.intellij.diff.tools.*, com.intellij.diff.util.*, com.intellij.openapi.diff.*).
  - Color values taken from the bundled color schemes and themes in
    platform/platform-resources/src (DefaultColorSchemesManager.xml, themes/expUI/*, themes/islands/*).
  - SVG icons copied from platform/icons/src/expui/** into packages/viewer/src/icons/svg/.

